                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/releases/tag/v13.3.1"&gt;Aspire 13.3.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h1&gt;Aspire 13.3.1&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's New in Aspire 13.3.1&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patch release for Aspire 13.3 with a regression fix for &lt;code&gt;aspire run&lt;/code&gt; and a DCP bump.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🐛 Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏃 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;aspire run&lt;/code&gt; compute environment validation&lt;/strong&gt; — Skip compute environment validation in run mode so customers no longer hit &lt;code&gt;Resource '&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;' is configured to publish as an Azure Container App, but there are no 'AzureContainerAppEnvironmentResource' resources. Ensure you have added one by calling 'AddAzureContainerAppEnvironment'.&lt;/code&gt; errors during local runs. The check is now only performed in publish mode, matching pre-13.3 behavior. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4422155317" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16945" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16945/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16945"&gt;#16945&lt;/a&gt;, backported via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4423528762" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16952" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16952/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16952"&gt;#16952&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🏷️ Housekeeping&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⬆️ Bumped DCP (Microsoft.DeveloperControlPlane) from 0.23.4 → 0.23.5 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4422150024" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16944" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16944/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16944"&gt;#16944&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌐 Updated localization resources (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4359880902" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16602" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16602/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16602"&gt;#16602&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Bumped branding to 13.3.1 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4423418236" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16951" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16951/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16951"&gt;#16951&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
